within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.N_NervousSystem.N06A_Antidepressants.N06AX26_Vortioxetine;
model Vortioxetine_Wilson2015_PD_rol
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Wilson_2015 :: ROL (REM onset latency)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 144,      // [s; min × 60]
    Emax = 15000,  // [s; min × 60]
    EC50 = 2.1e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 2.5,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 210, Interval = 0.42),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Vortioxetine_Wilson2015_PD_rol</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Wilson S et al., <i>Journal of psychopharmacology (Oxford, England) 29(10):1085–1091</i> 2015 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1177/0269881115599387\">doi:10.1177/0269881115599387</a>) — REM onset latency [min] against vortioxetine ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =        2.4 min      drug-free response (baseline) (E0, Q324)
  Emax  =        250 min      maximal effect term (Emax, Q320)
  EC50  =         21 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50, Q321)
  gamma =        2.5          Hill coefficient (Γ, Q325)</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of vortioxetine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 144   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (21 ng/mL)  response 7644
  exposure -> infinity  response 1.514e+04</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Wilson_2015: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Vortioxetine_Wilson2015_PD_rol;
